@Rivaldo, @Keeks, and @Nocturnowl will be doing another stream today! But this time we got a bit of a different timing! This time, it won't be us chasing the leaderboard anymore! It's time for a more fun challenge for us!

The community has spoken!
[b]Challenge #1[/b]: Snipers-only run. It's going to be messy!
[b]Challenge #2[/b]: Pick defensive lythons ONLY, or worst of the three lythons. 
[b]Challenge #3[/b]: Xi'an only weapons, challenge the Challenge Tower with Xi'an loots! Yup... may the RNG Gods bless us.

Aside from that, we will have an interactive stream! We invite @everyone here to join us on each of our streams and help us determine our run. Every action matters, and you... (unfortunately for us) have a say in it. 

@Rivaldo will be on Twitch: https://twitch.tv/playriftstorm
@Keeks will be on YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@playriftstorm
@Nocturnowl will be on Steam: https://store.steampowered.com/app/2282790/RIFTSTORM/

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43792726/511ef0d742ab79a0fee83a5e717ca628be034910.gif[/img]

